<title>SPAIN: Pryca gross sales to Nov down 0.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Pryca gross sales to Nov down 0.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish hypermarket Pryca said on Wednesday gross group sales in the eleven months to November rose to 518.8 billion pesetas, down 0.5 percent from the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>In a note dated December 3, Pryca said sales in November alone totalled 48.32 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
